Error`.\n\nReproducer:\n```python\nimport jax\nfrom jax import numpy as jnp\nfrom jax import export as jax_export\n\n# A value in host mem.\nshd = jax.sharding.SingleDeviceSharding(jax.devices()[0], memory_kind='pinned_host')\na = jax.device_put(1, shd)\n\n# WORKS\nf = jax.jit(lambda x: (x, jnp.eye(2)), out_shardings=(shd, shd))\nb, c = f(a)\nassert b.sharding == a.sharding\nassert c.sharding == shd\n\n# FAILS\n# JaxRuntimeError: INVALID_ARGUMENT: Tensor which is moved to host (starting from tuple.2) is returned from the entry computation but the layout for this output is not set to host memory.\ndo_export = jax_export.export(f)\nexported = do_export(a)\nexported.call(a)\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\njax:    0.8.2\njaxlib: 0.8.2\nnumpy:  2.3.5\npython: 3.12.11\ndevice: tpu","closed_at":"2025-12-01T18:39:50Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33558/comments","created_at":"2025-11-26T13:15:31Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ja